WEBVTT

00:00:14.330 --> 00:00:16.740
The Land of Truth Tellers?

00:00:16.740 --> 00:00:18.490
But on the map, it says--

00:00:18.490 --> 00:00:21.490
It changed to that name six months ago.

00:00:21.490 --> 00:00:25.910
As the name says, it has
become a country with no liars.

00:00:25.910 --> 00:00:27.290
Huh.

00:00:27.290 --> 00:00:29.040
Once you enter our territory,

00:00:29.040 --> 00:00:32.950
even if you're a witch,
your body will not be able to lie.

00:00:32.950 --> 00:00:36.240
Why in the world did this happen?

00:00:36.240 --> 00:00:39.740
It's because of the mysterious
power of the sword the king has.

00:00:39.740 --> 00:00:41.490
Sword?

00:00:41.490 --> 00:00:43.660
With the power of his sword brimming with magic,

00:00:43.660 --> 00:00:48.620
he has put up a barrier around the whole
country to keep those within from lying.

00:00:48.620 --> 00:00:51.450
That seems kind of shady.

00:00:51.450 --> 00:00:54.790
Madam Witch, you are already being honest.

00:00:54.790 --> 00:00:57.200
Actually, I agree with you.

00:00:57.200 --> 00:00:59.040
Well, what will you do?

00:00:59.040 --> 00:01:00.450
Will you enter the country?

00:01:00.450 --> 00:01:01.660
Well...

00:01:01.660 --> 00:01:04.790
I'm still of two minds, and still suspicious,

00:01:04.790 --> 00:01:09.160
but it sounds like it'll make
a good story, so I'll try going in.

00:01:09.160 --> 00:01:10.830
You <i>are</i> honest.

00:01:10.830 --> 00:01:13.790
Welcome to the Land of Truth Tellers!

00:01:13.790 --> 00:01:16.990
Welcome to this damned country!

00:02:53.580 --> 00:02:58.040
The Land of Truth Tellers

00:03:01.290 --> 00:03:04.740
The Land of Truth Tellers, huh?

00:03:04.740 --> 00:03:07.740
It looks like a normal town, though.

00:03:07.740 --> 00:03:11.870
For now, I'll test whether or not I can lie.

00:03:11.870 --> 00:03:16.160
I'll try saying "I am not beautiful."

00:03:18.040 --> 00:03:21.790
I am not beauti--beauti--

00:03:21.790 --> 00:03:24.660
I am very beautiful!

00:03:27.450 --> 00:03:30.950
Oh, my mouth moved on its own to tell the truth!

00:03:30.950 --> 00:03:35.330
It looks like what they said
about not being able to lie was true.

00:03:36.790 --> 00:03:41.870
Be that as it may,
it's kind of quiet around here.

00:03:48.410 --> 00:03:52.790
I wonder why no one's talking...

00:03:52.790 --> 00:03:55.580
Those look good.

00:03:55.580 --> 00:03:58.120
Are these freshly baked?

00:03:58.540 --> 00:04:00.830
Then, I'll take one, please.

00:04:04.240 --> 00:04:05.740
So hard... What's with this?

00:04:05.740 --> 00:04:09.990
It's hard and dry. It's probably
unsold bread leftover from yesterday.

00:04:09.990 --> 00:04:11.910
She made it sound like
it was freshly baked, though.

00:04:11.910 --> 00:04:14.910
What's so honest about this country anyway?

00:04:14.910 --> 00:04:17.660
Since they said there are
only honest people here,

00:04:17.660 --> 00:04:21.410
I was imagining that the people
would be more pure, somehow.

00:04:21.410 --> 00:04:23.660
Looks like I was wrong, though.

00:04:23.660 --> 00:04:26.040
Instead, they seem kind of distant,

00:04:26.040 --> 00:04:29.580
and things seem kind of tense.

00:04:29.580 --> 00:04:35.580
I wonder what made the king
decide to change the country like this.

00:04:39.450 --> 00:04:44.330
"You're the witch dispatched from
the United Magic Association, right?"

00:04:44.330 --> 00:04:47.200
No, that's not me.

00:04:47.200 --> 00:04:50.580
To put it simply, the United Magic
Association is a mysterious organization

00:04:50.580 --> 00:04:55.040
that meddles in everything
that deals with magic.

00:04:55.040 --> 00:05:00.740
Those affiliated with the association
have a brooch shaped like a moon.

00:05:07.160 --> 00:05:09.700
What was that about?

00:05:09.700 --> 00:05:13.870
Hm? What about if it's written down?

00:05:13.870 --> 00:05:17.490
Is it still not possible to lie?

00:05:17.490 --> 00:05:25.120
"New sweets! Actually, we just added
some new things to old products."

00:05:25.120 --> 00:05:27.660
"A mystery woven by a new author!

00:05:27.660 --> 00:05:32.950
Even that bestselling author
was shocked by how boring it was!"

00:05:32.950 --> 00:05:35.580
Hm, let's see...

00:05:35.580 --> 00:05:41.040
I'll try writing "I have a twisted
personality" and see what happens.

00:05:42.160 --> 00:05:45.620
I have a pure heart

00:05:45.910 --> 00:05:50.040
I see. You can't even lie through writing.

00:05:50.040 --> 00:05:51.410
What the hell?

00:05:51.410 --> 00:05:53.290
You're so stubborn!

00:05:53.290 --> 00:05:56.740
You're pigheaded, too!

00:05:56.740 --> 00:05:59.290
You scheming bastard! You should just die!

00:05:59.290 --> 00:06:01.540
You bellyacher! <i>You</i> should die!

00:06:01.540 --> 00:06:04.790
What did you say?! I can't believe you
went after a woman so out of your league!

00:06:02.080 --> 00:06:07.870
Oh my, just when I finally heard some
voices, it turns out it was an argument.

00:06:04.790 --> 00:06:07.870
Yeah, I was sure she liked me.

00:06:07.870 --> 00:06:11.120
Um, is it all right to let them go on like that?

00:06:11.120 --> 00:06:13.830
It helps us release stress, too.

00:06:13.830 --> 00:06:15.830
In fact, I wish they'd do it more.

00:06:15.830 --> 00:06:18.990
Oh, is that how it is?

00:06:18.990 --> 00:06:22.080
Why won't the people in this country talk?

00:06:22.080 --> 00:06:25.370
Because if we talk,
since we can only tell the truth,

00:06:25.370 --> 00:06:28.410
we'll end up fighting like that, of course.

00:06:28.410 --> 00:06:31.040
Miss Witch, are you an idiot?

00:06:31.040 --> 00:06:35.240
See? All of this is that stupid king's fault.

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:37.040
Whoops.

00:06:37.040 --> 00:06:43.950
Okay, stop right there!

00:06:55.160 --> 00:06:59.330
Can you please not have
a fist fight in broad daylight?

00:06:59.330 --> 00:07:01.790
Why didn't any of you stop...

00:07:01.790 --> 00:07:03.370
...them?

00:07:21.830 --> 00:07:24.080
Miss Elaina!

00:07:26.080 --> 00:07:28.580
Oh. I'm sorry!

00:07:29.830 --> 00:07:32.200
I didn't think I'd see you here!

00:07:32.200 --> 00:07:35.120
Is this fate? It is, isn't it?

00:07:35.120 --> 00:07:37.450
We have no choice but to get married, right?

00:07:37.450 --> 00:07:40.910
Putting that aside, it's been
a long time, hasn't it, Saya?

00:07:40.910 --> 00:07:43.120
I'm glad you seem to be well.

00:07:43.120 --> 00:07:45.160
Thanks to this hat...

00:07:47.080 --> 00:07:50.330
...and this treasure...

00:07:50.330 --> 00:07:52.240
...I'm doing very well!

00:07:52.240 --> 00:07:54.910
That's my...

00:07:54.910 --> 00:07:57.120
I was able to become a witch, too!

00:07:57.120 --> 00:07:59.790
I see. Congratulations.

00:07:59.790 --> 00:08:03.040
What's your witch title?

00:08:03.040 --> 00:08:04.990
The Charcoal Witch!

00:08:04.990 --> 00:08:08.990
Charcoal, huh? It's a little
like my "Ashen Witch."

00:08:08.990 --> 00:08:10.330
Of course.

00:08:10.330 --> 00:08:15.450
Because I asked my teacher
to choose a word close to "ashen."

00:08:15.450 --> 00:08:17.580
I see.

00:08:17.580 --> 00:08:20.660
Are you part of the United Magic Association?

00:08:20.660 --> 00:08:26.370
I thought it was the easiest way
to make money as I traveled.

00:08:26.370 --> 00:08:28.370
I'm in this country for work, too!

00:08:28.370 --> 00:08:29.330
Work?

00:08:29.330 --> 00:08:30.160
Yes!

00:08:30.160 --> 00:08:34.330
I bought something a little pricey,
so I need to work a lot...

00:08:34.330 --> 00:08:35.490
Speaking of which,

00:08:35.490 --> 00:08:38.870
I met someone earlier who was
looking for a witch from the association.

00:08:38.870 --> 00:08:40.660
Oh, what did they look like?

00:08:40.660 --> 00:08:43.950
I didn't get a name or address in the request...

00:08:43.950 --> 00:08:47.120
You incompetent witch! You're back again?!

00:08:47.120 --> 00:08:49.160
Hurry up and get out of here!

00:08:50.080 --> 00:08:52.670
Eek! I'm sorry! I'm sorry !

00:08:53.290 --> 00:08:55.620
Don't tell me it's that
weird person over there...

00:08:55.620 --> 00:08:58.240
It's that weird person.

00:08:58.240 --> 00:09:00.700
Do you think you could let go of me now?

00:09:00.700 --> 00:09:03.370
No, that's all right.

00:09:09.540 --> 00:09:14.910
Um... You were looking for a witch
dispatched by the association, right?

00:09:17.490 --> 00:09:20.660
Let me introduce you to my friend, Saya.

00:09:20.660 --> 00:09:23.620
"Friend" sounds so formal here.

00:09:23.620 --> 00:09:25.490
Oh, hello.

00:09:27.830 --> 00:09:34.120
"Sorry. I was in a hurry, so I forgot
to write my name and address."

00:09:37.790 --> 00:09:42.490
Eihemia, is it that you can't talk,
or that you won't talk?

00:09:42.490 --> 00:09:44.240
Which is it?

00:09:44.240 --> 00:09:47.740
"I lost my voice because of certain reasons."

00:09:47.740 --> 00:09:50.160
Are you going to write all the reasons?

00:09:50.160 --> 00:09:53.120
Oh, this looks like it'll take a while.

00:09:53.120 --> 00:09:54.660
Saya...

00:09:54.660 --> 00:09:58.660
Eihemia then told us about those reasons--

00:09:58.660 --> 00:10:02.580
No, she wrote them. From what she wrote--

00:10:02.580 --> 00:10:04.160
About six months ago,

00:10:04.160 --> 00:10:09.370
Eihemia, a witch who worked in the palace,
received a request from the king.

00:10:09.370 --> 00:10:11.830
Quicksand Witch, Eihemia,

00:10:11.830 --> 00:10:16.160
please use your power to get
rid of all the liars in this country.

00:10:16.160 --> 00:10:18.160
Huh?

00:10:18.160 --> 00:10:20.910
All my retainers are liars.

00:10:20.910 --> 00:10:25.790
I only want people near me who
will say what they really think.

00:10:26.950 --> 00:10:29.330
What should I do...?

00:10:30.450 --> 00:10:34.950
If I can help the king, then maybe...

00:10:37.450 --> 00:10:39.660
No way...

00:10:41.290 --> 00:10:42.540
I know.

00:10:42.540 --> 00:10:45.870
I just have to put up a barrier
that won't let people lie.

00:10:45.870 --> 00:10:49.620
Eihemia found a suitable sword in the castle

00:10:49.620 --> 00:10:54.450
and tried to make it a vessel
for the magic of the barrier.

00:10:54.450 --> 00:10:55.950
All right.

00:10:55.950 --> 00:11:01.120
Ianesana-ha, ianesana-ha...

00:11:01.120 --> 00:11:03.660
Ominano motera-do!

00:11:06.290 --> 00:11:10.330
But she needed a large amount
of magic to perform the spell.

00:11:10.330 --> 00:11:14.450
Eihemia poured in all her magic,

00:11:12.660 --> 00:11:14.450
Ominano motera-do!

00:11:14.450 --> 00:11:19.790
but that wasn't enough,
so she even gave up her voice

00:11:19.790 --> 00:11:23.290
to complete the barrier sword.

00:11:23.290 --> 00:11:25.740
I wonder why people who
are trying to accomplish things

00:11:25.740 --> 00:11:29.040
end up giving up their voices
or memories in exchange...

00:11:29.040 --> 00:11:29.950
Huh?

00:11:29.950 --> 00:11:32.490
Nothing, just talking to myself.

00:11:34.580 --> 00:11:37.740
Oh? A barrier sword?

00:11:37.740 --> 00:11:39.950
So you're saying that if
I hold this in my dominant hand,

00:11:39.950 --> 00:11:45.330
I can put up a barrier that will prevent
people from lying in this country?

00:11:48.040 --> 00:11:51.950
A land of truth tellers, huh? Not bad.

00:11:57.700 --> 00:12:02.120
But man, this sword is really lame.

00:12:02.120 --> 00:12:03.870
It's so gaudy.

00:12:03.870 --> 00:12:05.490
Even though it's to put up the barrier,

00:12:05.490 --> 00:12:08.330
I can't believe I have
to hold a sword like this...

00:12:10.830 --> 00:12:16.040
And so, the Land of Truth Tellers was born.

00:12:16.040 --> 00:12:19.290
By the way, since Eihemia
couldn't use magic anymore,

00:12:19.290 --> 00:12:23.120
she was thrown out of the palace
because she was now incompetent.

00:12:23.090 --> 00:12:28.120
I
didn't
have
any
worth
other
than
my
magic...

00:12:28.410 --> 00:12:30.740
You were hired as a witch,

00:12:30.740 --> 00:12:33.620
so of course you would be
valued mostly for your magic.

00:12:33.620 --> 00:12:38.620
Even
so,
I'd
been
hoping
that
he
would
still
keep
me
by
his
side

00:12:39.040 --> 00:12:41.620
Knowing that you gave up all
your magic and even your voice

00:12:41.620 --> 00:12:43.950
could be overwhelming, right?

00:12:43.950 --> 00:12:47.910
Don't you think that's what put off the king?

00:12:47.910 --> 00:12:51.740
So, your request is to put this country
back to what it was before, right?

00:12:51.740 --> 00:12:54.240
What should I do to put it back?

00:12:55.370 --> 00:13:00.120
Just
destroy
the
king's
sword.
Then,
my
magic
and
voice
will 
return
to
normal,
too

00:13:00.410 --> 00:13:01.870
I see.

00:13:01.870 --> 00:13:05.370
Should I aim for when the king
comes out of the castle or something?

00:13:06.260 --> 00:13:08.410
He
will
make
a
speech
in
one
month

00:13:09.080 --> 00:13:11.950
Miss Elaina! Let's stay in
the same room for one month

00:13:11.950 --> 00:13:13.450
and eat and sleep together!

00:13:13.450 --> 00:13:16.200
Oh, and bathe together, and we might
as well go to the bathroom together,

00:13:16.200 --> 00:13:18.160
and sleep in the same bed--

00:13:19.160 --> 00:13:21.540
Let's come up with a different plan.

00:13:21.870 --> 00:13:23.580
Going
into
the
palace
might
be
the
best
bet

00:13:24.700 --> 00:13:28.120
But if we can't lie, don't you
think it would be hard to get in?

00:13:28.120 --> 00:13:30.870
It doesn't look like we can get in from the sky,

00:13:30.870 --> 00:13:32.830
and security looks tight...

00:13:32.830 --> 00:13:38.740
It's the Land of Truth Tellers,
so it'd be hard to get in by lying.

00:13:38.740 --> 00:13:40.160
But.

00:13:40.160 --> 00:13:41.450
But?

00:13:41.450 --> 00:13:44.200
We can use that and make it work somehow.

00:13:44.200 --> 00:13:46.120
Somehow?

00:13:46.120 --> 00:13:49.410
A picture is worth a thousand words.

00:13:52.740 --> 00:13:54.910
What business do you have?

00:13:54.910 --> 00:13:59.830
You may not enter the palace
without permission from the king.

00:13:59.830 --> 00:14:03.870
You're back again?
You've been banished from here!

00:14:05.200 --> 00:14:09.700
Come on, Saya, please explain the situation.

00:14:09.700 --> 00:14:11.040
Very well.

00:14:11.040 --> 00:14:16.910
Ahem. Mr. Doorman, do you
understand what is written here?

00:14:16.910 --> 00:14:18.790
"The banishment

00:14:18.790 --> 00:14:20.290
of the witch, Eihemia,

00:14:20.290 --> 00:14:22.040
has been revoked,

00:14:22.040 --> 00:14:25.580
and she is to enter the palace
with Elaina, the Ashen Witch,

00:14:25.580 --> 00:14:27.080
and Saya, the Charcoal Witch.

00:14:27.080 --> 00:14:28.830
We have the permission

00:14:28.830 --> 00:14:31.120
of the king"? What?!

00:14:31.120 --> 00:14:33.120
Really?

00:14:33.120 --> 00:14:35.490
This is the Land of Truth Tellers, right?

00:14:35.490 --> 00:14:38.080
We can't lie, can we?

00:14:38.080 --> 00:14:39.870
Well, that's true...

00:14:39.870 --> 00:14:41.950
May we enter?

00:14:44.450 --> 00:14:48.490
Oh, that worked! As expected of Miss Elaina.

00:14:48.490 --> 00:14:50.870
It wasn't much.

00:14:50.870 --> 00:14:52.410
It was simple.

00:14:52.410 --> 00:14:55.240
We just had to write
the sentences down in chunks.

00:14:55.240 --> 00:14:59.240
Since none of the parts contained
any lies, they could be written down.

00:14:59.240 --> 00:15:01.450
Then, they just had to
be read in the right order,

00:15:01.450 --> 00:15:04.990
and we could write anything we wanted.

00:15:04.990 --> 00:15:08.040
The pen really is mightier than the sword, huh?

00:15:08.040 --> 00:15:10.370
I'm not sure about that, though.

00:15:10.370 --> 00:15:13.990
Eihemia, where's the throne room?

00:15:16.240 --> 00:15:17.870
There?

00:15:21.910 --> 00:15:24.540
Oh, could you be the king?

00:15:24.540 --> 00:15:26.450
Yes, I am.

00:15:27.450 --> 00:15:29.330
Please let go of that sword.

00:15:29.330 --> 00:15:31.830
If you don't...

00:15:31.830 --> 00:15:33.870
Intruders!

00:15:36.830 --> 00:15:39.240
What? There are three witches!

00:15:39.240 --> 00:15:40.790
One of them's Eihemia!

00:15:40.790 --> 00:15:42.080
Long time no see!

00:15:42.080 --> 00:15:44.330
Man, this is such a pain, and I'm sleepy.

00:15:44.330 --> 00:15:46.830
That witch has a flat chest,
but she's pretty cute!

00:15:46.830 --> 00:15:49.080
The boyish witch over here's my type!

00:15:49.080 --> 00:15:52.990
Oh, sorry, I already have
my heart set on someone.

00:15:52.990 --> 00:15:54.790
Please don't look at me.

00:15:54.790 --> 00:15:58.120
Saya, I will take the king.

00:15:58.120 --> 00:16:00.910
Please do something about the guards.

00:16:00.910 --> 00:16:03.870
Leave it to me, Saya, the Charcoal Witch!

00:16:04.160 --> 00:16:06.080
I am a non-combatant

00:16:07.200 --> 00:16:09.240
Please hand over the sword.

00:16:09.240 --> 00:16:10.450
What are you saying?

00:16:10.450 --> 00:16:15.370
This sword is the greatest weapon,
made to guide this country.

00:16:15.370 --> 00:16:19.330
As long as I have this, I can lead
this country in the correct direction.

00:16:19.330 --> 00:16:21.330
There's no way I'd hand it over!

00:16:26.240 --> 00:16:27.330
Sorry.

00:16:27.330 --> 00:16:28.740
So mean...

00:16:28.910 --> 00:16:31.260
That sword can release stored magic, so please be careful

00:16:31.840 --> 00:16:35.510
It'll hurt a lot if it hits you

00:16:33.950 --> 00:16:36.410
Please tell us that first next time!

00:16:45.290 --> 00:16:47.330
Damn it!

00:16:48.790 --> 00:16:51.290
Did getting rid of lies

00:16:51.290 --> 00:16:54.080
make this country any better?

00:16:54.080 --> 00:16:57.700
Of course it did!

00:16:57.700 --> 00:17:00.330
Is that really true?

00:17:00.330 --> 00:17:01.740
What?!

00:17:01.740 --> 00:17:07.540
People with evil intent can
do evil things without lying.

00:17:07.540 --> 00:17:10.080
Just because this country
became full of truth tellers

00:17:10.080 --> 00:17:14.200
doesn't mean that everyone in
this country became a good person.

00:17:14.200 --> 00:17:17.830
And not all liars evil.

00:17:17.830 --> 00:17:20.450
Sometimes white lies can act as lubricant

00:17:20.450 --> 00:17:23.410
to smooth over relationships between people.

00:17:23.410 --> 00:17:27.910
Without that, people just grate on
each other's nerves and become tense.

00:17:27.910 --> 00:17:29.240
That's not true!

00:17:29.240 --> 00:17:32.870
If the sword is the truth,
then lies are the scabbard (saya).

00:17:32.870 --> 00:17:34.080
Yes?

00:17:34.080 --> 00:17:37.580
I wasn't talking to you.
I was talking about a sword scabbard.

00:17:37.580 --> 00:17:39.410
Well, that's confusing!

00:17:39.410 --> 00:17:41.120
What is?

00:17:41.120 --> 00:17:44.410
If the sword is truth, then lies
are the scabbard for that sword.

00:17:44.410 --> 00:17:47.700
To keep us from swinging the truth
around recklessly and hurting people,

00:17:47.700 --> 00:17:50.160
the truth is wrapped in lies.

00:17:50.160 --> 00:17:52.990
You little... Babbling on like that...

00:17:52.990 --> 00:17:54.410
Miss Elaina!

00:17:54.410 --> 00:17:56.700
There are too many enemies!
I can't take care of them all.

00:17:56.700 --> 00:18:01.580
I feel like my brain's going to explode!

00:18:01.760 --> 00:18:03.200
Do your best !

00:18:03.450 --> 00:18:06.370
Well, it looks like Saya is at her limit, too,

00:18:06.370 --> 00:18:08.240
so let's end this.

00:18:08.240 --> 00:18:10.330
End this?

00:18:10.330 --> 00:18:13.290
Haven't you had to use everything
you've got just to hold back my attacks?

00:18:13.290 --> 00:18:14.870
No, I'm sorry.

00:18:14.870 --> 00:18:18.330
I've already been prepared
to take that sword from you

00:18:18.330 --> 00:18:20.410
for a long time.

00:18:36.830 --> 00:18:38.700
The really lame sword!

00:18:41.490 --> 00:18:44.240
You did it, Miss Elaina!

00:18:49.740 --> 00:18:53.990
Are you saying... that I was wrong?

00:18:53.990 --> 00:18:56.240
No, Your Majesty.

00:19:03.290 --> 00:19:04.870
Eihemia...

00:19:04.870 --> 00:19:09.540
Your desire to be honest is not wrong.

00:19:09.540 --> 00:19:13.540
But from now on, why don't you relax a little...

00:19:13.540 --> 00:19:21.490
...and lie and be lied to as
you govern this land... okay?

00:19:41.830 --> 00:19:43.830
Fresh bread!

00:19:43.830 --> 00:19:46.660
Do you want some fresh fish?

00:19:46.660 --> 00:19:49.540
You really are a good guy, huh?

00:19:49.540 --> 00:19:52.990
And you've really got some guts!

00:19:54.580 --> 00:19:57.200
The king recognized his own mistake

00:19:57.200 --> 00:20:02.160
and apologized to the country's citizens
for making it so they couldn't lie.

00:20:02.160 --> 00:20:05.790
I don't know if the country
will go back to how it was,

00:20:05.790 --> 00:20:08.660
but Eihemia is back at the palace,

00:20:08.660 --> 00:20:11.080
so I'm sure it'll all work out, somehow.

00:20:11.080 --> 00:20:13.660
Madam Witches, thank you very much!

00:20:13.660 --> 00:20:16.120
Have a safe trip!

00:20:16.120 --> 00:20:19.330
Um, the association's rules state

00:20:19.330 --> 00:20:22.330
that I must give you a present
to thank you for your help.

00:20:22.330 --> 00:20:24.240
Huh? I don't need anything.

00:20:24.240 --> 00:20:28.950
If you do everything by the book,
then you'll become inflexible.

00:20:28.950 --> 00:20:31.040
But please let me thank you!

00:20:31.040 --> 00:20:33.120
It's nothing big, but--

00:20:33.120 --> 00:20:35.870
Ta-da!

00:20:35.870 --> 00:20:38.540
A necklace?

00:20:38.540 --> 00:20:45.790
I bought this with all the money I had
on hand to give you when I saw you again.

00:20:45.790 --> 00:20:49.830
I took this job because I'd run out of money,

00:20:49.830 --> 00:20:54.290
but that's how I got to see
you again, so it must be fate!

00:20:54.290 --> 00:20:56.700
Please think of it as me and treasure it!

00:20:56.700 --> 00:20:58.490
Huh? Your feelings are overwhelming.

00:20:58.490 --> 00:21:01.080
But, thank you very much.

00:21:01.080 --> 00:21:03.080
I'll put it on for you.

00:21:03.080 --> 00:21:04.240
Huh? Wait.

00:21:04.240 --> 00:21:06.700
Don't hold back.

00:21:17.790 --> 00:21:19.450
It looks good on you!

00:21:19.450 --> 00:21:22.660
Now we match!

00:21:24.950 --> 00:21:29.290
Well, I need to head to
the association branch office.

00:21:29.290 --> 00:21:30.990
Where will you go?

00:21:30.990 --> 00:21:34.290
I'm heading to another unknown town somewhere.

00:21:39.370 --> 00:21:43.160
It's a promise charm that
is used in my homeland.

00:21:43.160 --> 00:21:45.540
Please hook your pinky in mine.

00:21:50.910 --> 00:21:53.580
Let's meet again someday.

00:21:53.580 --> 00:21:56.330
I want to introduce you to my sister,

00:21:56.330 --> 00:22:01.160
and I'll be a better witch by then, too!

00:22:01.160 --> 00:22:02.790
I promise!

00:22:02.790 --> 00:22:07.370
Yes, I'll wait patiently as I travel.

00:22:07.370 --> 00:22:08.950
I promise.
